=== claude openrouter, key not set
--- turn t_1 harness="claude" access="openrouter" model="" read_only=false
refused 400 this agent reads its OpenRouter key from OPENROUTER_API_KEY, which is not set where the turn runs; set it and restart agentbus
log run.refused agent=claude access=openrouter reason=wire
=== claude own endpoint
--- turn t_1 harness="claude" access="" model="" read_only=false
refused 400 the service's environment already sends this agent to another endpoint; unset it and restart agentbus
=== claude missing
--- turn t_1 harness="claude" access="" model="" read_only=false
refused 400 agent claude cannot start: the program claude is not on the service's PATH. Install Claude Code and run claude once to sign in, then try again. If it is installed, start agentbus from a shell where claude runs.
log run.refused agent=claude program=claude reason=not_on_path
